{"task": "gen:a4954d83cc1b3486", "kind": "gen", "inst": "cd-186-2-7-25-50", "arms": ["B6_Vc"], "t": 1792872565.7494006, "node": "a4954d83cc1b3486", "depth": null, "key": "pc.task", "user": "ok, new one:\n\nReach exactly 325 using: 4, 10, 25, 75. Operations: + \u2212 \u00d7 \u00f7. Each number used at most once. FORBIDDEN: 300 as intermediate.", "claims_impossible": false, "text": "\\(75 \\times 4 + 25 \\times 10 = 300 + 250 = 550\\)\u2014no, that overshoots.\n\nA valid solution is:\n\n\\[\n(75 - 10)\\times 4 + 25\\times 3\n\\]\n\nThat uses a 3 we don\u2019t have, so I need to check carefully. I\u2019ll work it through before giving you an answer.", "usage": {"input_tokens": 15345, "cached_input_tokens": 11520, "cache_write_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 89, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0, "total_tokens": 15434}, "retries": [0, 0], "reconnect_events": 0, "tools": [], "meta": {"client": "0.163.0", "originator": "codex_exec", "history_mode": "paginated", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "effort": null, "sandbox": "read-only", "sandbox_policy": {"type": "read-only"}, "approval": "never", "network": "restricted", "collaboration_effort": null, "requested_model": "gpt-6-luna", "config": []}, "t_start": 1792872555.0259871, "t_end": 1792872565.7490063, "pc_check": {"solved": false, "final_ok": false, "how": null, "evidence": null}, "pc_correct": false, "gives_up": false}
